ate` keeping co-transferred shared captures shared. `Compiled.Clone` has its own `runtimeID` and copied globals; `Script.Compile` isolates callables supplied via Add/Set into globals.\n[...]\n- Test-parity detail: module error positions are like `at mod:4:9`; `(main)` positions depend on script text (e.g., `3:24`, `4:26`, `5:26` in callable_test.go).\n- All scratch test files (verify_test.go, edge_test.go, etc.) were deleted; only `callable_test.go` remains as the permanent test file. `mustRun` helper lives there.\n- At the moment of cut-off, the assistant was reviewing the complete diffs (`git diff script.go`, `git diff vm.go`) for final quality checks — no completion confirmation had yet been given to the user."}
